  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to ISSAT, a Division of the Geneva Centre for Security Sector Governance (DCAF). DCAF&#x2019;s mission is dedicated to improving the security of states and people within a framework of democratic governance, respect for human rights and the rule of law. ISSAT benefits from DCAF&apos;s administrative and logistical support, as well as access to DCAF&apos;s personnel, expertise and research capability. DCAF, in turn, benefits from ISSAT&apos;s operational expertise and experience, good practice gathering, and training capacity. DCAF&apos;s Foundation Council and Directing Board also provide additional levels of oversight.</narrative>
  </description>
